### Priority 2 — Railway Token Regeneration
- Go to https://railway.app/account/tokens → Create new token
- Set in backend/.env and provide to Sonit for re-run

### Priority 3 — Railway ADMIN_JWKS_URL
- Railway Dashboard → Core service → Variables → Add:
  ```
  ADMIN_JWKS_URL=https://practical-amazement-production.up.railway.app/.well-known/jwks.json
  ```

### Priority 4 — Merge Sequence
1. Merge `fix/admin-mount-pr101` first → Railway deploys
2. Fix lint on `fix/workflow-instance-terminal-start` → merge second

